    "Id": "chassisdef_fox_CS-2",
    "Name": "Fox",
    "Details": "Created during the Golden Century by Clan Sea Fox, the CS-2 Fox had few equals. The 50-ton Mech was powered by a 300-rated cXL engine, that propelled the Mech to speeds of 97 km/h. Protected by 10 tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor, the CS-2 Fox was armed with a pair of LRM-15’s and an ER Large Laser. At closer ranges, a pair of ER Medium Lasers, a pair of Streak SRM-2’s and a pair of Machine Guns provided additional firepower. Production of the Fox mysteriously stopped partway through the Golden Century as the Mech was dropped from use in the Sea Fox Touman.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Variable Range Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
